<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank data show fall in net reserves in week.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank data show fall in net reserves in week.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Monday show net currency reserves fell to about 100.7 billion marks in the week ending July 23 from about 101.4 billion marks in the week ending July 15.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data: (in</p>
<p>billion marks)</p>
<p> Banking week ended		    July 23	 July 15</p>
<p> Gross currency reserves	     116.6	   117.3</p>
<p> Foreign liabilities		   15.9	    15.9</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
